5,1,1,talk,May,,Let's make sure this is actually fair for everyone. I want to know exactly who has been burdened and how much space we're dealing with.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree. We need to understand the daily reality of the site. It's not just about rules, but how it feels to live next to it.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'm worried about the money! We have different budgets, so we need to know the actual costs before we decide on anything expensive.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Midori,,I hope we can find a solution that makes everyone feel comfortable again. It's important that we all get along after this is settled.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Patience is a virtue, my friends. Let us look deeply into the time and effort required, so no one person carries the weight alone.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"@Kenji, money is one thing, but physical space is another. If it stays in one spot, that person pays a ""space tax"" every day.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Exactly. We should look at how other blocks handle this. A theoretical plan is different from a practical, daily routine.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"That's true, but if the cost is too high, some people might not be able to pay. We need to check the subsidies!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Midori,,I think it would be helpful to see what was said in previous meetings. Maybe we can avoid repeating the same arguments.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"A wise observation, Midori. However, we must also consider the administrative burden. Filing papers can be as draining as lifting bins.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,May,,I'm going to check the complaint log. I want to see if the complaints are coming from the person hosting the bins or others.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I'll look into the actual living conditions of other setups. I want to know what it's like to live beside these arrangements.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I'll take the financial side! I'm going to check the ledger and the ward subsidies to see how much we can save.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Midori,,I'll look into the meeting minutes and the resident statements. I want to understand the history of our disagreements to help us move forward.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,I shall investigate the filing requirements and the supervised mornings. I want to know exactly how many hours of our lives this will consume.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
